  "term": "sexual aversion disorder",
  "definition": "Sexual aversion disorder is a diagnosis in which a person repeatedly or persistently feels an intense dislike of sexual contact and avoids all genital contact with a sexual partner. The aversion is not better explained by another psychiatric disorder.",
